LanguageData.M3AT_PolyAboutText:
Models with higher poly counts are performance heavy on M3AT's animation system with little visual benefit.

<b>M3AT's counts, for reference</b>
  Pawn body: {0} polys
  Shirt: {1}
  Duster: {2}
  Power armour: {3}
  Cat ears pair: {4}{5}

M3AT automatically reduces extreme poly counts to more reasonable levels (set in Auto Optimization), but content created as optimized will provide the best performance and looks.

Making something for M3AT? M3AT's apparel guides (in the mod's Docs folder) can help you or an AI do it in the best way.
